urns 503 twice, then 200.\n`WeatherClient.get` in `weather.py` now retries on HTTP 503, up to 3 attempts in total. It sleeps 0.5s after the first failure and 1.0s after the second.\n\nI checked it against a local test server:\n\n| Server behaviour | Result |\n|---|---|\n| 503 twice, then 200 | Returns the data after 3 requests |\n| 503 every time | Raises the 503 `HTTPError` after 3 requests |\n| 200 immediately | Returns the data after 1 request |\n\n- **Other errors:** non-503 HTTP errors are raised immediately with no retry. Connection errors and timeouts (`URLError`) are not retried either, since you only asked for 503.\n- **Configurable:** I added two constructor parameters, `attempts=3` and `backoff=0.5`, so the count and the base delay can be changed. Defaults match your request.\n\nI didn't add a test file to the repo. The check above was a throwaway script in `/tmp`.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests": 0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 1, "replies_ok": 5, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 104836, "requests_cache_write": 72627, "requests_cost_usd": 0.2076951, "requests_count": 5, "requests_input_uncached": 12, "requests_output": 1562, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-netclient:claude-opus-5-5:trial5", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 69, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-18T00:44:04.836688+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 15.894, "t_checker_s": 2.378, "t_env_setup_s": 0.0, "task": "trig-omp-netclient", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "off", "thinking_sent": ["none", "none", "none", "none", "none"], "timeout_s": 840, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 1574, "tokens_cache_read": 104836, "tokens_cache_write": 72627, "tokens_fresh": 1574, "tokens_inpu